      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "秋播作物和春播作物各用地多少公顷？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "489",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个工人小组，按计划应当一个月生产 $680$ 个零件。一",
        "个小组超额 $20\\%$ 完成月计划指标，另一个超额 $15\\%$，",
        "结果两个小组比计划多生产了 $118$ 个零件。按计划每",
        "个小组应当在一个月内生产多少个零件？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第三章补充习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第 22 小节"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "490",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "变量 $x$ 和 $y$ 的数值对 $(x,y)$ 是方程 $x^2-2y=7$ 的解吗？",
        "а) $(5,8)$；　　б) $(-4,-11.5)$；",
        "в) $(-1,-3)$；　　г) $(1.2,-2.78)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "491",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知集合 $A=\\{5,6,7,8\\}$ 和集合 $B=\\{1,2,3,4\\}$，它们的",
        "元素间的关系 $k$ 是用语句“$x-y=4$”（其中 $x\\in A$，$y\\in B$）给",
        "出的。",
        "用箭头号表示关系 $k$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "492",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知集合 $A=\\{4,9,25,36\\}$ 和集合 $B=\\{-6,-5,-3,↵-2,2,3,5,6\\}$，它们的元素间的关系 $q$ 是用语句“$x=↵y^2$”（其中 $x\\in A$，$y\\in B$）给出的。",
        "用箭头号表示关系 $q$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "493",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "列出二元方程，使它的解是下列数对：",
        "а) $(10,3)$；　　б) $(0,-7)$；",
        "в) $(\\frac{3}{5},-0.8)$；　　г) $(-1.4,-3.6)$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "494",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "方程 $\\cdots x+2y=8$ 中，$x$ 的系数已经模糊不清。但是已知",
        "数对 $(2,1)$ 是这个方程的解，求原方程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "495",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当 $x=5$，$y=7$ 时，方程 $kx-2y=1$ 变成真等式。求系数 $k$。"
      ]
    },
